<title>POLAND: Polish shares close mixed in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close mixed in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Five stocks rose, three fell and 10 were flat in 19.4-million-zloty continuous trade on Wednesday with the WIG 20 index closing at 1,628.1 points, 0.4 percent lower than at the regular session.</p>
<p>The remaining five stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units were flat in a 7.3-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
